                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJDSgyVE-rQjQRXy9Z9vJMWBA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Od2FGaG5ORTFOVVRKTFkyZFZiekUxUjFGbFJFRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I\u0027m a local from Jingmei, and I have to say this is the best breakfast place in Jingmei! I come here three times a week. Both the egg pancakes and toast are delicious, and they\u0027ve got a unique flavor compared to other breakfast places. The owner is very friendly and energetic. It\u0027s a small but wonderful hidden gem of a shop! 🫶🏻🥰",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "我是景美在地人，必須說這間是我覺得景美最好吃的早餐店！一個禮拜會來這邊報到三次，不管是蛋餅還是吐司都很好吃，有做出跟其他早餐店的差別，老闆非常親切有活力、一間小而美的寶藏小店🫶🏻🥰",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
