                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJDSgyVE-rQjQRXy9Z9vJMWBA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oUWJXUTBiR2RmTWxaMlpESXpTRXRxYVZVNFRrRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "7 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Support stylish little places!\nThe owner is enthusiastic and energetic!\nWe ordered the Spicy Prince Fried Noodles, the Fruit-Pickled Pork Chop Omelette, and the Apple Mashed Potato Thick Egg Toast.\n\nThe Apple Mashed Potato Thick Egg Toast is refreshing and perfect for those who want a healthy breakfast and want to avoid oily foods.\n\nThe Fruit-Pickled Pork Chop Omelette is crispy and the meat is tender.\n\nThe Spicy Prince Fried Noodles is incredibly flavorful!\n\nThe seating is limited and cramped, but I highly recommend giving it a try!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "支持有風格的小店！\n老闆熱情、充滿活力！\n我們點了「麻辣王子炒泡麵」、「果漬豬排蛋餅」、「蘋果薯泥厚蛋吐司」。\n\n「蘋果薯泥厚蛋吐司」：清爽解膩，適合要吃健康餐、早餐不能吃太油的人\n\n「果漬豬排蛋餅」：蛋餅是脆脆的，肉質軟嫩。\n\n「麻辣王子炒泡麵」：炒泡麵非常的入味！\n\n座位比較少、比較窄。但是非常推薦來試試看！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
