                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJDSgyVE-rQjQRXy9Z9vJMWBA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jNFltcFVNR0kyTWtac1FrVnlXa2gwVGtGaFRHYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Having lived in Jingmei for so long, this is my go-to breakfast spot ❤️ The owner is very nice and the service is excellent.\n\nAlthough there aren\u0027t many seats, and sometimes you have to sit outside, the breakfast is so delicious it\u0027s worth it 😊 I highly recommend the stir-fried instant noodles; you can add a set meal!\n\nIt also includes cabbage, egg, and sliced ​​meat, and it\u0027s not too salty 👍🏼\nThe milk tea is the classic breakfast shop milk tea—delicious!\n\nThe food comes out very quickly too—far better than other breakfast shops.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "住景美那麼久，最常去吃的早餐店❤️\n老闆人很好服務也超好\n雖然位子不多，有時候需要坐外面，但早餐好吃都值得😊\n推推炒泡麵，可以加購套餐！\n裡面還有高麗菜+蛋+肉片，也不會太鹹👍🏼\n奶茶就是早餐店經典奶茶，好喝！\n出餐也很快～～大勝其他家早餐店",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
